uality collagen and full spectrum cannabinoids available:\r\nSupports balanced mind and body\r\nPromotes healthy relaxation\r\nNatural antioxidant activity\r\nPromotes positive stress control\r\nSupports healthy inflammation control\r\nMaximized absorption - Superior source hydrolyzed collagen with collagen digesting enzymes to maximize absorption.\r\nSourced from grass-fed beef, wild-caught fish, cage-free chicken, eggshell membrane and eco-grown hemp. Clean, sustainable ingredients are the best collagen sources.\r\nThese 6 major collagen types (I, II, III, IV, V & X) provide a powerful profile delivering exceptional whole body benefits.\r\nControl of temporary inflammation resulting from strenuous activity.\r\nFull Spectrum Collagen provides whole body results:\r\nType I - Skin Elasticity\r\nType II - Joints and immune system\r\nType III - Skin, Blood Vessels, Vital Organs\r\nType IV - Cell Health and Growth\r\nType V - Skin, Tendons and Immune System\r\nType X - Joints, Bones, Muscles and Hair"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Certified Non-GMO\r\nGluten Free"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Environmentally responsible\r\nRecyclable/Renewable"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"GMP Independently Certified"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Clean\r\nPure\r\nOptimized"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Sustainably caught"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"350MG of Hempceutix"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"I | II | III | IV | V | X Types of natural collagen"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Soft skin\r\nStrong nails\r\nHair growth\r\nGut health\r\nJoint relief\r\nClean ingredients, clean taste"},{"type":"Suggested/Re